Subject: [PATCH 18/18] ttf: define the mark classes the uncompiled lookups
 name

The reader turned GPOS mark classes into anchors but left the uncompiled mark lookups
naming them (`mark @bottomleft`) with no markClass statement, so a font with mark
attachment converted to features fontc could not compile ("undefined mark class":
Yinmar, Almarai). The markClass definitions are now written before the lookups too.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
